From 22449f6ac209f053962db2f1169baef52bd3b1fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QuizSpark Dev <dev@quizspark.local>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:35:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): redesigned Home, Ranking and My Page shell; fix
 auth loading bug

Home: two-column on desktop (cards + sticky profile card), stacked on mobile; accessible login/register dialog
(labels, role=dialog, autocomplete, role=alert); no emoji; theme/notification/admin use labelled IconButtons.
Ranking: rows are real buttons; tier shown with SVG icons; rank bands in src/lib/rank.ts (checked against server).
My Page: header card with avatar, @id, rank chip and rate; tabs are a proper tablist with SVG icons.

Bug fix: Home and My Page read 'authLoading' from useAuth(), which does not exist (the context exposes 'loading'),
so (a) logged-in users saw the login dialog flash on load and (b) reloading /profile redirected to home before the
user was fetched. Regression guard test added. Also: User type gains email/rate/titleId; removed dead quickJoin().
Docs finding: HelpPage rank table disagrees with the server thresholds (to be fixed with the Help page).
Emoji baseline 131 -> 120.
